      "acceptance_test": "Owner uses synthetic records with success plus failed>0, missing, boolean, noninteger or negative counters, and unbound commit/date fields. Require invalid or explicitly unverified semantic evidence, preserving legitimate unavailable counts for failed runs without promotion.",
