      "current_blob_revalidation_required": true,
      "detail": "The verifier requires field presence and a tests dictionary but validates neither test counters nor their consistency with conclusion. The summary counts conclusion=success as green. The separate record-junit producer rejects success with failed tests at lines154-155, but the verifier and ordinary record path do not enforce that rule.",
      "finding_id": "R4-WITNESS-001",
      "impact_inference": "A hash-consistent success record with a positive failed count can reach a green/MEASURED summary. This is an inferred source branch, not an observed CI result or release bypass; origin authentication remains separate.",
